<title>POLAND: POLISH BANK HANDLOWY MAY NET AT PLN 38.4 MLN.</title>
<headline>POLISH BANK HANDLOWY MAY NET AT PLN 38.4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results May</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MAY						  1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					 38.40 vs   63.03</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   65.25 vs   96.58</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		101.56 vs  101.20</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     139.92 vs  114.64</p>
<p> JANUARY-MAY					1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					209.65 vs  320.43</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				  338.99 vs  441.13</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		506.26 vs  476.15</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     728.73 vs  580.47</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank, whose privatisation offer</p>
<p>ended earlier this month, is Bank Handlowy SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
